2 Syntax Overview
=================

The syntax of Classes.Defs follows Common Lisp conventions with
parentheses.  Each definition is a form that begins with a keyword.

     (defclass Player
       ((health :initform 100 :accessor player-health)
        (inventory :initform (make-list 10) :accessor player-inventory))
       (:methods
        (move (dx dy) ...)
        (attack (target) ...)))


