5 Inheritance and Slots
=======================

Inheritance is specified by adding a :superclass keyword option to the
defclass form.  Slots inherit from superclasses and can be overridden
with different :initform or :accessor.

     (defclass Enemy (Character)
       ((strength :initform 15 :accessor enemy-strength))
       (:methods
        (damage (amount) ...)))


